-- Kill existing form definition
Kill !!MdsParaErrors

-- Define Form
Setup Form  !!MdsParaErrors at xr0 yr0 blocking

  !!MdsParaErrors.formtitle    = |MDS Warnings|
  !!MdsParaErrors.icontitle    = ||
  !!MdsParaErrors.Callback     = ||
  !!MdsParaErrors.formrevision = | $Revision: 1.1.19.1 $ |

  -- Body of Form
     list   .list   |Parameter Loading Errors| at x1.25 ymax+0.5 call || width 33 length 10

-- End form definition
exit



